<metadata><name>Galičica trail T-1</name><desc>T-1 is one of Galičica National Park's harder and longer hiking trails, with more climbing. It runs 6.1 km from St Parascheva to the H-4 junction, climbing about 682 m and descending 85 m in the direction drawn, between 770 m and 1,457 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/t-1/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
